<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab fighters captured a village near Mataban in central Somalia and seized Coomaad in Hirshabelle, prompting protests against the regional election. A Somali-American Uber driver was brutally assaulted in Minnesota, a hate-crime attack that left him in critical condition, while a Somali refugee woman was killed by Houthi shelling of a camp in Lahj. Militia forces killed eight Somali civilians near the Kenya-Ethiopia border, and heavy rainstorms in Lower Shabelle killed a mother and two children. Uganda is withdrawing its troops from Somalia, raising security concerns around Mogadishu, and Uganda denies that its soldiers were killed in the country. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQM0QzRGZIakk0QkFFVk9xNk9YZ1Y3QW1aVTIzbm9ual9Qb2JzNDdja05Vb1ZZZGRoLVR2dS1tN1lfY0xRSTg4c1BoMVRndExjUDJ3dUdiX3Q4dS1FUjJDODJIVGQ2SXk2SUhaMlRTTVFxeGxJamE3ZHRyZ2hzVHlHM2tBVHdlV2N1U0llRlphaEdYTjVwb1NJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOVVpLZFNEV2paZDFnNnJWc3JCYk5mZXlGQ241eGIxSHY5ZUU0ZTQ1Q1I4MjVfSXZHUjJfMzdqaUJ4cE82QUhuUEEzUFhhTk5tQXk3SjhWM2xWaEVTaUZXZk5hdGdYazZ6dHNicUQzbE9WMlhHT2VGeDN6WHpBTzRFcDZwQXhiN3kwSC1YZHBhb1ZkbkE3eFd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUlpmeWd5aHZwdmFLYS15Rk9ZR0xZXzZ5N1RHQktYYjBIclNWZ3lkRGI4ZUpZajlzRjY3YzJTMEFRYUJMRTdkY3ZBRnpxX25nWFhkZzBsVEZzSWw3ZTQxUGtLWTdxUnl1SDc3a0RwaHVqcjlPUmFtYy04MU1vYnQyakhRZEFpZ3hpX2M4M3Z5MjhSellDeGJrak5jYVJUM2FFQWFJRWZLM0loTDVkQzl2bllabUpzSE5PeW9DTFd5SWtjYWZWMmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Indiatimes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl